//! The engine's settings, compiled in — the evaluation layer's copy.
//!
//! Generated by this crate's `build.rs` from the same TOML config the rest of
//! the engine is built from (`configs/default.toml` unless `YORKIE_CONFIG`
//! names another one), through the same shared schema and code generator. The
//! generated file is included verbatim below; nothing here is hand-written, and
//! there is no way to change a value at run time.
//!
//! The evaluation layer reads exactly one key — `fv_scale`, re-exported as
//! [`crate::FV_SCALE`]. The others are rendered because the generator renders
//! the schema as a whole; they are allowed-but-unused rather than filtered out,
//! so this file cannot drift from the protocol crate's copy.

#![allow(dead_code)]

include!(concat!(env!("OUT_DIR"), "/engine_config.rs"));
